WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.847
Status Trio merges

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:02.519
Wi-Fi

00:00:02.614 --> 00:00:04.123
battery and volume

00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:05.959
Status Trio is

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.232
a free open-source

00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:08.777
macOS app inspired

00:00:08.589 --> 00:00:09.567
by the iPhone's

00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:10.711
combined status bar

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:11.902
that folds Wi-Fi

00:00:12.103 --> 00:00:13.423
battery and volume

00:00:13.235 --> 00:00:14.544
into one configurable

00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:15.204
icon for the

00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:16.053
menu bar or

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:16.419
Dock

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.860
version 1.10.4 shipped

00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:20.110
Nov 22

00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:21.711
The status panel

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:23.020
switches audio devices

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.069
and shows top

00:00:23.893 --> 00:00:25.296
apps by CPU

00:00:25.414 --> 00:00:26.215
GPU

00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:27.595
memory and network

00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:28.043
use

00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:29.529
The repo has

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.486
about 2,100 stars

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:32.878
and is Apache-2

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:33.173
.

00:00:32.984 --> 00:00:34.033
0 licensed

00:00:34.069 --> 00:00:34.871
the post is

00:00:34.682 --> 00:00:35.614
in Chinese

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.164
Full story on

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:37.871
the dashboard
